00:18:58.537 --> 00:19:01.540
But they found a nice spot here
underneath the roof.

00:19:01.540 --> 00:19:04.543
I'm going to leave them there
because the...

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:08.413
swarm doesn't
get as big as for example, with wasps

00:19:09.214 --> 00:19:12.217
and hornets, which are more of a threat.

00:19:12.551 --> 00:19:15.554
But those are fine here.

00:19:17.289 --> 00:19:18.690
The males can sting.

00:19:18.690 --> 00:19:21.727
They're more aggressive and buzz
around your head, but they can’t sting.

00:19:21.760 --> 00:19:24.429
Females can sting,

00:19:24.429 --> 00:19:26.398
