00:22:43.528 --> 00:22:44.563
it needs some more gravel,

00:22:44.563 --> 00:22:48.266
And then the soil in the rest . that needs to be finished first.

00:22:48.967 --> 00:22:50.869
And then,

00:22:50.869 --> 00:22:53.372
